== Effect ==
* Spawns a [[familiar]] that follows Isaac around and fires [[slow|slowing tears]] that deal 3.5 damage.
** {{dlc|nr}} Little Gish shoots once per second.
** {{dlc|r}} Little Gish shoots 1.36 times a second.

== Notes ==
* Little Gish can drop by defeating {{e|Gish}}.
* {{dlc|r}} [[Familiar]]s that follow behind Isaac have a certain priority in how close their position is to him over other familiars. 
** {{dlc|nr+}} Little Gish has 5th priority.
** {{dlc|r+}} Little Gish has 7th priority.

== Synergies ==
* {{I|Mongo Baby}}: Will copy Little Gish’s tears.

